  "notes": "そわそわ is an onomatopoeic word describing restlessness from anticipation.\n\nCOMMON TRIGGERS:\n- ⟦{楽|たの}しみ→楽しみ：01651_tanoshimi⟧⟦な→な：09497_na⟧⟦こと→こと：01164_koto⟧ (something to look forward to)\n- ⟦{待|ま}ち{合|あ}わせ→待ち合わせ：07397_machiawase⟧ (meeting someone)\n- ⟦{結果|けっか}→結果：02486_kekka⟧⟦{発表|はっぴょう}→発表：03562_happyou⟧ (waiting for results)\n- ⟦{緊張|きんちょう}→緊張：02494_kinchou⟧ (nervousness)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦びくびく→びくびく：05266_bikubiku⟧: nervous, scared (fear-based)\n- ⟦はらはら→はらはら：05268_harahara⟧: anxiously watching (worried about outcome)\n- ⟦わくわく→わくわく：05158_wakuwaku⟧: excited (positive anticipation)",
